<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87358" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεπ-αγγέλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>announce before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς μαντευσόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					38.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. σφίσιν αὐτὸ τοῦθ᾽ ὅπως . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					40.32
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐλογία -ηγγελμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
					9.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -ηγγελμένα</span>”
				<i>matters on which orders had been issued,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					6.27.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>canvass for an office before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				39.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>announce before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαγγέλιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be promised before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				42.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				46.40
			</span></i>.</div>
